# 2010 Honda CRF450R

## Identification
- Model Year: 2010
- Platform: Third-gen (2009–2012)
- Updates: Revised ECU, new decompression, suspension tweaks

## Stock Sprocket Fitment
- Front: 13T (spline)
- Rear: 48T
- Chain: 520 / 116 links

## Aftermarket Gearing
- Common setups: 13/49, 13/50, 14/52
- Preferred by riders for stronger 3rd gear acceleration

## Hubs & Spacers
- Front Axle: 20mm
- Rear Axle: 25mm
- Hub Group: Honda 2009–2012
- Spacer Kit Group: Honda standard fitment

## Wheels
- Front: 21” x 1.60”
- Rear: 19” x 2.15”
- Spokes: Front 36 / Rear 32

## Notes
- 14T front sprocket may have clearance issues
- Use Talon SKU cross-references for premium hub fitments
